<!-- AVP_OpenInteng's project. Written 2026-11-14 by Melanikus (Hicks) for AVP_OpenInteng.

     WHAT IT BUILDS TODAY (the phase 2 plan, F2; R-INT-15, option A): the editor's own start, still empty (src\probe\probe_main.cpp),
     with the game's own files from the avpx submodule: 284 of the 319 the game compiles. docs\avpx-files.md lists the 35 it leaves out
     (the game's start, its network code, its online pages, Hudson and the player's settings file) and why. What those 35 would have given the rest of the game is
     "the edge", in src\host\: tools\make-edge.js writes it from the linker's own list, and docs\host-symbols.md says what each part of
     it does. /p:NoEdge=true builds without the edge, for that list.

     THE COMPILE SETTINGS ARE THE GAME'S OWN, copied from avpx\win32\VS2026\AvP.vcxproj's Release|Win32 block at the pinned commit
     (85704f7a), so the editor's game files are the game's: the same defines, the same /fp:fast, /J (a plain char is unsigned) and
     /we4834, the same /sdl, Control Flow Guard and /MD, the same optimisation and whole-program optimisation. A same-flags gate is to
     prove that they stay the same when the pin moves (the phase 2 plan, section 2). Only the include folders point into avpx\, and the
     editor is a Windows program, with no console (the Link settings below); the F4 stock proof is a console one. The editor's own files are C++17.

     Built only inside AvP-builds-excluded, in lane T2, with release libraries only. VcpkgInstalledDir and VcpkgTriplet come on the
     command line (the folder holding the release libraries, and their name), as for the game, so no private path is written here. -->
